## Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

## Register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin123",
    "name": "Admin"
}